          "body": "The `windows` job failed because native tests could not create OpenGL contexts and a procedural export assertion compared aliased and canonical project paths.\n\n- **Graphics:** Provision checksum-pinned Mesa llvmpipe beside Java for both test and embedded-game JVMs. Accept Mesa device strings without skipping graphics tests or changing numerical tolerances.\n- **Path assertions:** Compare resolved paths and add an aliased-root regression.\n- **Diagnostics:** Upload subproject HTML and JUnit XML reports; record outcomes and the remaining Windows execution gate in engineering continuity.",
